<h2>9. Intellectual Property</h2>

<h3>9.1 Our Property</h3>
<p>The Service, including its software, design, text, graphics, logos, and content created by H.E.L.P. Center (collectively, "Our Content"), is owned by us or our licensors and is protected by copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws. We grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use the Service for your own internal business purposes during the term of your active subscription.</p>

