<p>You retain all ownership rights in Your Content. By using the Service, you grant us a worldwide, royalty-free, non-exclusive license to host, store, process, transmit, and display Your Content solely as necessary to provide the Service to you. We do not claim ownership of Your Content and will not use it to train models or for any purpose unrelated to providing the Service.</p>

<h3>9.3 Joy Watford's Proprietary Content</h3>
<p>Certain content within the Service — including but not limited to Joy Watford's coaching guides, business pathways, AI prompts, and educational materials — is the proprietary content of H.E.L.P. Center and is licensed to you solely for personal use within the Service. You may not redistribute, resell, or republish this content outside the Service.</p>

<h2>10. E-Signature Service Disclaimer</h2>
<p>The Service offers integrated e-signature functionality, either through our built-in service or via third-party providers configured by you. Electronic signatures collected through the Service are intended to comply with the U.S. ESIGN Act and applicable state UETA statutes. However, the legal validity and enforceability of any specific signed document depends on many factors including jurisdiction, document type, and the parties' intent. <strong>We do not provide legal advice and make no representation that any signature collected through the Service will be enforceable in any particular legal proceeding.</strong> You are solely responsible for the legal sufficiency of your documents and for retaining appropriate signed copies and audit trails for your records.</p>

<h2>11. AI Service Disclaimer</h2>
<p>The Service includes AI-powered features (AI Business Coach, AI Project Suite, content generation tools, etc.) that use third-party large language models. <strong>AI-generated output is not legal, financial, medical, tax, or professional advice. AI output may contain errors, inaccuracies, or fabricated information.</strong> You are responsible for reviewing, verifying, and validating any AI-generated content before relying on it for any decision. We are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your reliance on AI-generated content.</p>

<h2>12. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>The Service integrates with third-party providers including but not limited to Groq, OpenAI, Anthropic, Stripe, Resend, SignFlow, and DocuSeal-compatible services. Your use of these third-party services is governed by their own terms and privacy policies, which we encourage you to review. We are not responsible for the acts, omissions, availability, accuracy, or content of third-party services.</p>

<h2>13. Data Ownership and Portability</h2>
<p>You own Your Content. At any time, you may export your data from the Service in JSON format through the in-product Export feature. Upon account termination, we will retain your data for 30 days to allow restoration if you change your mind, after which all data is permanently deleted from active systems. Backup copies may persist for an additional period before being purged per our backup rotation schedule.</p>

<h2>14. Service Availability and Modifications</h2>
<p>We strive to keep the Service available 24/7 but do not guarantee uninterrupted access. We may temporarily suspend the Service for maintenance, security, or other reasons with reasonable notice when possible. We may modify, add, or remove features at any time. We will provide notice of material changes that adversely affect your use of the Service.</p>

