<h3>19.1 Informal Resolution</h3>
<p>Before filing any formal claim, you agree to first contact us at <span class="placeholder">[SUPPORT EMAIL]</span> and make a good-faith effort to resolve the dispute informally for at least 30 days.</p>

<h3>19.2 Binding Arbitration</h3>
